# Orrin's Sledge Camp (CIPlay orrins_sledge_camp): the barn (the bears come), Orrin's note 1, two polar bears, the sledge
# shed, Orrin's hut (note 2), the cook hut (note 3), the lookout, the zipline crate, Orrin's note 4.
island Orrin's Sledge Camp
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Sledge Camp
expect animals Goat 3
zone barn
expect step 1
read Orrin's note 1
expect step 2
kill Polar bear
expect step 3
open Sledge shed
wait 3
expect step 4
open Orrin's chest
wait 3
expect step 5
read Orrin's note 2
open Camp stores
expect item Bucket 1
read Orrin's note 3
zone lookout
open Lookout box
wait 3
expect step 6
open Zipline crate
wait 3
expect done
read Orrin's note 4
